he motor, and"}},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/fallbackMarkdown","o":"replace","v":"# Best trolling motor battery setup (2026)\n\nFor most fishing boats, the best setup is a **24V or 36V LiFePO4 lithium battery system**, depending on your trolling motor's voltage and power requirements.\n\nLithium iron phosphate (LiFePO4) batteries are generally preferable to traditional lead-acid batteries because they're lighter, offer more usable capacity, maintain voltage better under load, and typically last through more charge cycles.\n\n## Recommended setups\n\n| Trolling motor | Recommended battery setup | Best for |\n|--------|--------|--------|\n| 12V | 12V 100Ah LiFePO4 | Kayaks, jon boats, small fishing boats |\n| 24V | 2 \u00d7 12V 100Ah in series or 24V 100Ah | Bass boats, medium fishing boats |\n| 36V | 3 \u00d7 12V 100Ah in series or 36V 100Ah | Larger bass boats, high-thrust motors |\n\n**My overall pick\\:** A dedicated 24V 100Ah LiFePO4 system for a compatible 24V trolling motor. It's a practical balance of runtime, weight, and cost.\n\n## Batteries worth considering\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn915006product17\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn915006product17\",\"LiTime 24V 100Ah Bluetooth Lithium Battery with Low-Temp Cut\u2026\"]\ue201**\n\nBest 24V all-around option\n\n## \\$539.99\n\nBluetooth monitoring and 100Ah capacity for longer fishing sessions.\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn915006product29\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn915006product29\",\"WattCycle 24V 50Ah TM Bluetooth LiFePO4 Battery for 70-100lb\u2026\"]\ue201**\n\nBudget 24V option\n\n## \\$229.99\n\nCompact 50Ah battery, suitable for shorter trips and lower energy requirements.\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn915006product12\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn915006product12\",\"LiTime 36V 100Ah Compact Bluetooth Lithium Battery for Troll\u2026\"]\ue201**\n\n36V high-capacity option\n\n## \\$929.99\n\nDesigned for larger 36V trolling motors, with Bluetooth monitoring.\n\n## Essential installation components\n\n- **Circuit breaker\\:** Use the motor manufacturer's specified rating. Minn Kota commonly specifies 50A or 60A, depending on the model.\n- **Marine-grade wiring\\:** Size it according to current draw and cable length.\n- **Lithium-compatible charger\\:** Match the battery voltage and charging specifications.\n- **Battery management system (BMS)\\:** Confirm its continuous and peak discharge limits can handle the motor, and"}],"c":11}      

